'''Pop Art''' is a [[Rare Weapons|rare]] knife that is obtainable by purchasing the 19th tier in the Battle Pass for 15,200 [[Beach Balls (Currency)|Beach Balls]] {{Currency|Beach Ball}} In the ongoing [[Summer Event 2025|2025 Summer Event]].

== Appearance ==
The knife uses the same mesh as the [[Default Knife|default mesh]]. It shows a cartoon [[Nikilis]] yelling the Japanese phrase “夏だよ” (Romaji: ''Natsuda yo'', English: It's summer). The background consists of pink polka dots against a blue gradient. A vibrant pink bubble tea is seen near the handle of the knife.

== Trivia ==
* It has a [[Pop Art (Gun)|partner gun]] under the same name. 

